# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Trained model weights and serialised estimators
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# These are build outputs, not source. Together they come to ~2.6 GB,
# which is far beyond GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit and beyond the
# free Git LFS quota. Rebuild them with train_all_models.py and
# train_classical_models.py.
*.h5
*.keras
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.pb
saved_model/
checkpoints/

